Z||000000||1FST2M6||02-16-2000||04:19 PM||||Had quite a few people ask about my seats and everyone want to see them. so here ya go... Their a pain to get in and out of but they do their job keeping you in one spot!  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/corbeau.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/corbeau.jpg</A>  <BR>||||reg||1
