Z||000013||FIEROCIOUS||02-21-2000||04:09 AM||||Hey just a suggestion, when getting out put your left hand down on the door sill and pivot/rotate out useing your hand to balance!<BR>I'ts the only way I can get out of my raceing seats!<P>(If you already thought of this disregaurd)||||reg||14
Z||000014||1FST2M6||02-21-2000||08:36 AM||||Yep thats the only way to get out.. the "drunk roll" The forzas we measured and the shoulder supports are 22" accorss. the area where the seats fits is  22". While at AUTOMOD here in Atlanta we test fit one and with the window up the seat would rub it! thats with the Corbeau seat tracks. As for the rotating seat tracks the 73 chevelle my neighbor has has that! That would be a good idea in a fiero if there was room for it to spin!||||reg||1
